    "title": "120-Acre Land Deal Could Bring New Hospital Campus to Manatee County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chuck Merlis ,\n1 days ago Roughly 120 acres along Manatee County’s State Road 64 corridor could eventually become a full-service hospital campus under a nearly $60 million land deal Sarasota Memorial Health Care System is working to complete. The Sarasota County Public Hospital Board approved the acquisition Tuesday for property just east of Interstate... Read full article\n2",
